  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Ranitidine, Cimetidine and metal hydroxides like aluminium hydroxide can be used as an antacid but not phenelzine. Phenelzine is not an antacid. It is an antidepressant. Antacids are a type of medication that can control the acid levels in the stomach.&nbsp;"
